{"assets":["/statement-assets/38b944433f5142d60186d8216b278c4f25c31536b345a6196fe2035c77cb3289.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"215","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Bicycle Chain"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya's bicycle chain drive consists of two parts: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" stars are attached to the pedal axle, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" stars are attached to the rear wheel axle. The chain helps to rotate the rear wheel by transmitting the pedal rotation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We know that the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th star on the pedal axle has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 < a1 < a2 < ... < an)"},{"kind":"text","text":" teeth, and the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th star on the rear wheel axle has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 < b1 < b2 < ... < bm)"},{"kind":"text","text":" teeth. Any pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, j)"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ j ≤ m)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is called a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gear"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and sets the indexes of stars to which the chain is currently attached. Gear "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, j)"},{"kind":"text","text":" has a gear ratio, equal to the value "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/38b944433f5142d60186d8216b278c4f25c31536b345a6196fe2035c77cb3289.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since Vasya likes integers, he wants to find such gears "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, j)"},{"kind":"text","text":", that their ratios are integers. On the other hand, Vasya likes fast driving, so among all \"integer\" gears "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, j)"},{"kind":"text","text":" he wants to choose a gear with the maximum ratio. Help him to find the number of such gears."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the problem, fraction "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/38b944433f5142d60186d8216b278c4f25c31536b345a6196fe2035c77cb3289.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" denotes division in real numbers, that is, no rounding is performed."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first input line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 50)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of stars on the bicycle's pedal axle. The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ ai ≤ 104)"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the order of strict increasing."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third input line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ m ≤ 50)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of stars on the rear wheel axle. The fourth line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ bi ≤ 104)"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the order of strict increasing."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there exists at least one gear ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i, j"},{"kind":"text","text":"), that its gear ratio is an integer. The numbers on the lines are separated by spaces."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the number of \"integer\" gears with the maximum ratio among all \"integer\" gears."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n4 5\n3\n12 13 15\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2 3 4\n5\n10 11 12 13 14\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample the maximum \"integer\" gear ratio equals 3. There are two gears that have such gear ratio. For one of them "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1 = 4, b1 = 12"},{"kind":"text","text":", and for the other "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2 = 5, b3 = 15"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"215A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/215/problem/A"}